<title>UK: TABLE - Mercury Asset Mgmt year pretax rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Mercury Asset Mgmt year pretax rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		66.7		   vs 53.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 35.0		   vs 29.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 45.0		   vs 35.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     179.2		  vs 140.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   356.5		  vs 286.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results include exceptional items.</p>
<p>Excluding exceptionals, pretax profit was 171.3 million stg versus 140.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 170.0 and 175.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Mercury Asset Management Group Plc.</p>
<p>-London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
